Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing love with fear. A thank
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nessuno può sfuggire dal destino scelto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman solo il risultato e\Nche voi sarete distrutti.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a body to be left behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe! I know! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it shit like Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that damn sculptor\NI keep hearing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Really shouldn't screw around\Nwhen you're at gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky my orders\Nwant to kill you outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, now that I\Nsee you're a stand user,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say I'm not\Ntempted to just put one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,between your eyes and get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing is, I still gotta\Nfind out who the hell you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll come back to the matter\Nof your girlfriend's fall later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know, Bucciarati,\Nand why did you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, are you a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be the case,\Nthey would never...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy with the gun gets\Nto ask the questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So play along if you don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't try anything funny, because I\Nam seriously not in the mood right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:03:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Every word that comes out of your\Nmouth better be 100 % true, or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll ask you\None question at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with an easy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a mafioso?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you belong to a\Nsyndicate, tell me which one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind, I can find\Nout later if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.06,0:03:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm little more than a regular sculptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hardly well known, but\NI make enough to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain how you became a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't know what\Nany of those words even mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're referring to this power,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.24,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it just sort of appeared\None day when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it the same for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a lot more to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you follow me\Nall the way from the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And how does some randu like\Nyou know who Bucciarati is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that happen to be his name by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He entered the building with...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't answered any of my\Nquestions, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're not going\Nto like what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The rock has its own independent will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always been that\Nway, as far as I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there's nothing\NI can do to rein it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you are not the person it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the rock is\Nseeking out Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look stupid to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You better get serious about\Nthis right freaking now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,unless you never want to\Npick up a chisel ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Bucciarati's\Nnowhere near this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So quit trying to fool me, because\NI can hurt you a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one fooling yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati is without a\Ndoubt inside this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm begging\Nyou to let me see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,His life is in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say about lying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't test my patience, you murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I should end you for killing that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Nplotting now, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Which part of Don't Try Anything\NFunny wasn't clear to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It wants nothing from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to share some art history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sculptor Michelangelo once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I approached the marble with chisel in\Nhand, But with no thought in my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For the stone already knows well The form\Nit is destined to take And to that end
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are tools Made simply to deliver\Nthe medium But never shape it Laurie,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that's enough, you goddamn nerd!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need you to bring that\Nstupid rock back here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I'll shoot you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A sculpture's ultimate form is not\Ngiven Michelangelo would conject?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The sculptor's only job was to\Nunearth What fate had already created.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.66,0:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He could see Fate's design growing\Nclearer with each strike of his chisel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not give the stone\NBucciarati's shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither did your bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was solely Fate's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:06:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you saw the massive\Nchest wound and gush of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it will be in days or\Nmonths, none can really say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.62,0:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is the way in which\NBucciarati will meet his end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are nothing\Nmore than slaves to Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the significance behind my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Prophecy stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last warning I'll give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring that damn rock back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if your dumbass eats it,\Nthen so does your little stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If he touches my prophecy stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise he'll be granted a\Nmerciful release with no suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, I only wish\Nto hear his last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this guy's deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he mocking me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard hasn't flinched\Nonce this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you seriously want me to spray the\Nplace with your insides, then wish granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I got three whole bullets\Nwhile you just have one brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at what\Nfate buried in your mushy ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're trying to do something\Nweird to Bucciarati, so stop playing dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Call your freaking rock back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't want to test\Nhow much time you got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said, at this point there's\Nnot a single thing more to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the bullshit act and bring\Nthe rock back, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The florist who sent you, his\Nlegs were no good, were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know it yet, but it's an\Nearly symptom of some organ disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One he won't overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after the daughter passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,her healthy organs were\Npreserved for transplantation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and will eventually save the man's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor girl found out about\Nher father's ailment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,from the rock and learned\Nthat in a few months,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,she'd contract the disease too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a revelation she accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She chose death to save her father\Nand to avoid suffering later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why\Nshe embraced the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She was freed from the dark\Nfate awaiting her and granted
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,a merciful death which would\Nleave all her organs intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty messed up way of saying\Nyou killed an innocent girl, psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a misfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like that bullet was a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that bullet was supposed to be\Nstupid number five's responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my time yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My death still hasn't found\Nits form in the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really think I'm going\Nto shoot two blanks in a row,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,then you've lost your tiny little mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What you felt just now\Nwas destiny nudging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost any real desire\Nto shoot me. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me\Nwith all this destiny bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way any of that\Nmade-up nonsense is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard's just nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, are you there, Fugo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some news on our sculptor friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, the guy's\Na stand user. Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the weirdo won't shut up about\NBucciarati and Destiny and whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make sense of anything\Nhe's been babbling about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say the same about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Bucciarati there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He got out of the car right after you and\Nheaded straight to the apartment building.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure he would've\Ncaught up with you at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.74,0:09:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fugo, can you remember what the\Nnumber to Bucciarati's phone was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really important that I\Nget to him right the hell now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The phone you're calling\Nis Bucciarati's, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mista, you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Bucciarati, quick! Hello? You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, princess, nap time's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me how to stop this\Ndamn rock from killing my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You answer me right freaking now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me exactly what I\Ngotta do to stop that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,dumb pebble of yours\Nfrom reaching Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me save my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I think I'm starting to\Nget all that stuff you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But you gotta tell me how\Nto turn this ship around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Puchirati is not touching that rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.94,0:10:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, what's the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you do not resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Acceptance is the easier path.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, if you're set on defying\Nthe rock, there might be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can destroy it or\Nreshape it somehow, then maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We found him, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We got eyes on Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A report came in from Number\NOne confirming it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati is somewhere\Non the seventh floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the stairwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's climbing the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good, not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It beat us to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it together, Number One!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on getting there\Nand tell him not to touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Number One's bullet doesn't\Nhave nearly enough juice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,left in it to get him all\Nthe way there in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Six bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like we did to the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's cool that we've\Ngot it crumbling and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think we might have just\Nmade stuff a whole lot worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bullets, why don't you fill\Nme in on what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we dealing with a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And can any of you explain why\Nthe hell it looks like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.80,0:12:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Mujiraji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Zipperman, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you touch it, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down from there, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, trust me, you're not gonna\Nwanna lay a finger on that rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One small tap and it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do that as soon\Nas we get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that stone mass supposed to be a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.72,0:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop asking me all these questions\Nand run away for your life already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's slipping away again,\Njust like in the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing could attack at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to find another way to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This stairwell just turned\Ninto a goddamn death trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay on our toes\Nand climb out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it? I hate that slippery\Nlittle bastard. Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister what is it you've learned
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever son of a bitch it's\Nright above you look out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this rock bear that face
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to destroy the rock Or at\Nleast try to change its shape somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I smash it into the\Npavement from this high?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be enough to\Nshatter its ass to bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He was telling the truth after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything went just as he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't see your\Nown mug carved inside the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you get to live on for at\Nleast another day. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you\Ndoing in there, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You left the recorder in the\Ncar after your tantrum, doofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what on earth were you in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, I'd very much like the\Nexplanation you promised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, none of it matters anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know where to\Nbegin, even. Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the old man's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the boyfriend, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But technically, it also wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, he's not leaving the\Nhospital for at least a few months, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Unhelpfully vague as ever. Classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do we kick his ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, was it suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you start from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But see, that's the thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really hard to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,piece this whole thing together\Nin a way that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,all you need to know is that I\Ndestroyed the mean old rock stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so everything's peachy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, how's about you let me take\Nover the whole leaky eye Luca thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reporting skills would slow things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I'll do just fine on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo, our florist friend\Nshould get a detailed account.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather what you can from Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, you know you\Nhave my utmost respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But this guy here, he's a\Npuzzle even I can't solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.66,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, don't hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to use Abakio's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So naive, do you really\Nbelieve this is the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you had accepted the stone's\Nmercy, all would be peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But you chose to remain enslaved to fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That which is carved in\Nstone cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, I hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A perilous journey of hardship awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And for some of you, it\Nwill be the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder, are all of you like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That young man flung\Nhimself off a tall building,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,all for a chance to save his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the path you are bound to walk\Nisn't one of meaningless suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The adversity you'll endure may well\Nbe the crucible of hope for another,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and perhaps it could be the\Nbirth of a greater purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wishing for their safety will do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only hope that\Nthey are sleeping slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping slaves will eventually awaken to\Ndiscover some meaning in their suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to heal Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:17:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I just rub my gun on his wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Something really weird just popped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go? Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did that girl go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right there behind you. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, it's all right. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing I tripped on\Nwas next to the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go leaving me behind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I gave you all a fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.18,0:18:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll still take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long way for a lone turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.26,0:18:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If our souls were switched back to normal,\Ndoesn't that mean yours should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My original body has perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But the moment my spirit\Ndeparted my flesh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure to hang on as tight\Nas I could to this turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remain bound to this key for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you won't mind little\Nold spectral me tagging along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot damn, I'll admit I'm glad to\Nsee you still kicking and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But the day's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need to patch\Nout Bucciarati's injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought his soul was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking maybe\Nyou might have had a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My pits, they actually do smell like ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I'm just\Nnow learning about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should put on cologne after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I might have exaggerated\Na little bit earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything happens so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I don't think\Nyou smell that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.94,0:20:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In a super weird kind of way,\Nit actually feels nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but your fingers are freakish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, what's your choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When those who've left us\Nplace their wills in our hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it is our sacred duty to carry it forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.28,0:20:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.72,0:20:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you keep the\Narrow in the turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.64,0:20:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll do, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A worthy decision to fulfill\Nyour duty as a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:21:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go to the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the mission,\Nthey are the blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but they dare to tell us\Nwhat's bad and what's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, join us, run,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say this a lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we are the power, close to the\Nfuture, cause we are the fighters,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,just fighting for a right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
